window.products.push({"id":255028,"name":"Andreas Silicone Maple Non-Slip 8\" Trivet/Pot Holder/Hot Pad, 100% Cotton, Dishwasher Safe, Hot Dishes, Protect Hair Iron, Safe up to 600°F","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UELZ6+gVL._AC_.jpg","description":"Andreas silicone trivets are made by encapsulating fabric within highly heat resistant silicone. These durable trivets are designed to protect your kitchen counters, dining room tables and other surface areas from heat – up to 600-degree-fahrenheit! Andreas silicone trivets are non slip. Plus, with Andreas' unique patterns and designs, you'll have a trivet that's whimsical and elegant, at the same time. Use it every day and use it on special occasions! Plus, it'll last for years of everyday use and it is dishwasher safe. 8-inch in diameter. Maple leaf design.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UELZ6+gVL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ANDRÉAS","source_asin":"B00G29XXNO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255028","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00G29XXNO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00G29XXNO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255029,"name":"Lush Decor Sydney Floral Leaf 3 Piece Reversible Quilt Bedding Set, Full/Queen, Green & Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iCszFn4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add a touch of luxury to your home with our Sydney 3-Piece Floral Leaf Quilt Set. The set includes a quilt and 2 matching pillow shams. Our quilt set allows you to transform your bedroom into a calm and peaceful escape from the world. Both the quilt and the pillow shams have reversible designs, so you will never get bored. Change the look and feel of your entire room by simply flipping the quilt or the shams over. On one side, the pieces feature a charming floral pattern while the other side is a blue floral and leaf pattern. Both sides will brighten up your master bedroom or guest room without overwhelming the room's design. The quilted blanket also provides some texture to your room. The pillow shams and the exterior of the quilt are made from 100% cotton, which is extremely durable and breathable. This material also helps wick away moisture as you sleep.This set is designed for a full/queen-size bed, but we also offer a king size. The quilt measures 92\" L x 88\" W, and each pillow sham measures 20\" L x 26\" W. We recommend washing your quilt set in the washing machine on a cold, gentle cycle with similar colors. Tumble dry on low to maintain the look and feel of these luxurious bedding pieces. Iron on low heat as needed, and use only non-chlorine bleach. The colors on our cozy bedding coordinate with other colors in your home without being overwhelming. The design can accent any interior design style, from rustic to modern.At Lush Decor, we offer a range of home products that are luxurious yet affordable. All of our products are made by a team of in-house designers who aim to create items that are functional, fashionable, and unique. Shop our line of home accessories, ranging from curtains to bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91iCszFn4PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lush Decor","source_asin":"B0BWFL6LW5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255029","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWFL6LW5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWFL6LW5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
