window.products.push({"id":255084,"name":"RevoMax Twist Free Insulated Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Standard Mouth","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEfKFDHaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"If you think twisting a screw-top bottle, or sipping your favorite beverage from a small opening is fun, then do not start to use a revomax twist-free water bottle, because there might be no way for you to turnaround! revomax twist-free water bottle is empowered with revomax's revolutionary thread less instant cap technology to allow you to fully open/close your water bottle with one hand in one click. Sipping from it, you would feel as if you were drinking gracefully from a covered teacup. Of course, instead of just at home, you can use it anywhere with the same convenience. Revomax vacuum insulated flask offers 50% superior performance as compared to the regular vacuum insulated thermos due to its extra energy reflection layer and double layer seals. A free ice funnel include in the package is an added feature to allow you to directly pour in ice cubes from most refrigerator dispensers. All revomax vacuum insulated flasks are responsibly made with 18/8 food grade stainless steel and BPA-free materials, and are powder-coated (except for the classic stainless steel) to bring a brand new hydration experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NEfKFDHaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RevoMax","source_asin":"B019W4KD4W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255084","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B019W4KD4W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B019W4KD4W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255085,"name":"DWCN Ombre Blackout Curtains for Bedroom - Damask Patterned Thermal Insulated Energy Saving Grommet Curtains for Living Room, Set of 2 Gradient Window","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8162+AJbEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your package will include 2 gradient damask blackout curtains, each curtain panel measures 42 x 63 inches. 6 sliver grommets (1.6-inch inner diameter) of each panel make the curtains easy to install and slide and suitable for most standard rods in the market. These ombre blackout curtains are made of durable polyester fabric. It can block most of sunlight and UV rays. They can also insulate summer heat and winter chill, balance room temperature to save spends in energy costs. Protecting furniture from color shading and utmost privacy. Thermal curtains are good for night shifts, late sleepers and afternoon naps. The depth of the curtain color gradually becomes darker from top to bottom. Elegant damask pattern with natural gradient effect on the front of the curtain (and the back is white solid color) will add a unique luxury view to your home, bedroom, living room, dining room and other rooms. Our medallion patterned blackout curtains with premium workmanship are color resistant and tear resistant, feature quality stitch work, inspected to ensure no loose threads, all seams and hem aligned. These room darkening curtains are machine washable in cold water, gentle cycle, tumble dry on low, do not bleach, low temperature ironing if needed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8162+AJbEgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DWCN","source_asin":"B08C2FYC1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255085","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C2FYC1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C2FYC1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
