window.products.push({"id":255126,"name":"Bedsure Cooling Sheets Set, Rayon Made from Bamboo, California King Sheet Sets, Deep Pocket Up to 16\", Hotel Luxury Silky Soft Breathable Bedding Shee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":66.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NUW0KZRJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Silky Soft: Bedsure California King Sheet Sets are made from a rayon from bamboo with a unique twill weave that makes the bed sheets stronger than cotton and smooth like silk. Sleep like you're on a cloud with our comfy sheets. Cool & Dry All Night: Experience the ultimate comfort and luxury with these bamboo rayon sheets set. They are made from bamboo rayon fiber with moisture-wicking and thermoregulation properties to keep you cool in summer and warm in winter. Deep Pocket & Easy Fit: A deep pocket fitted sheet is included in the set and fits mattresses up to 16 inches thick. The elastic band around the edge ensures a secure fit that won't shift while you sleep. The included silky-smooth envelope closure pillowcases reduce friction on your hair, keeping your locks smooth and healthy. Easy to Care: These Bedsure chill sheets are OEKO-TEX Standard 100 certified for high safety standards. Simply machine wash them in cold water on a gentle cycle for a like-new restoration, do not use bleach and fabric softener. What You Get: This California king set includes 2 pillowcases (20\" x 40\"), a flat sheet (108\" x 102\"), and a fitted sheet (72\" x 84\") with full elastic and a deep pocket that tightly fits mattresses up to 16\" thick without shifting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NUW0KZRJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BEDSURE","source_asin":"B0BZ8T5BJ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255126","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ8T5BJ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ8T5BJ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255127,"name":"Precious Moments 203014 Love at First Sight Bisque Porcelain Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":62.32,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FXKCMIk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Expecting a new baby is such an exciting time! From the moment the new parents see the first sonogram image and hear that precious heartbeat, they are in love! This figurine captures the moment a proud mom and dad hold up a sonogram picture, eager to share their happy news. This figurine makes a great way to announce a pregnancy to family, friends, or to post on social media. It’s the perfect present for baby showers or to honor the announcement of a new baby on the way. Measuring approximately 5.5”H, this touching figurine is meticulously sculpted of fine bisque porcelain and is skillfully hand-painted. For more than 40 years, Precious Moments has been devoted to making the world a kinder place by helping people share love. A timeless brand, Precious Moments helps you celebrate everyday moments and commemorate special occasions with hand-painted porcelain figurines and ornaments as well as contemporary kitchenware, home décor, baby gifts, and more. A unique inspirational message lies at the heart of every Precious Moments product, thoughtfully designed so you can turn your special moments into memories that last a lifetime.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FXKCMIk8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Precious Moments","source_asin":"B08VYJH6VQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255127","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VYJH6VQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VYJH6VQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
