window.products.push({"id":255130,"name":"Wildkin Kids Microfiber Twin Sheet Set for Boys and Girls, Bedding Sheet Set Includes Top Sheet, Fitted Sheet, and One Standard Pillow Case (Trains, P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JqLFVCbEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"GROW UP WITH US: Wildkin, a household name in children's products, is a small business proudly based in Nashville, Tennessee. We offer fantastic backpacks, lunch boxes, sleeping bags, bedding, and more for kids, toddlers, and teens! Your kids will love our designs and you'll love our quality and pricing! We make useful, fun, and safe gear for kids. We offer excellent quality non-toxic products with coordinating accessories that you can mix and match. Our high-quality and unique bedding lines include items like comforter sets, sheet sets, pillow options, all for boys and girls. Decorating your kid’s room, no problem, we also offer clocks, furniture, and rugs. PRODUCT FUNCTIONALITY AND SAFETY: Drifting off to slumberland is a breeze when your child is snuggled up in Wildkin’s ultra-cozy twin comforter kids sheet sets for boys and girls! Each set includes 1x top sheet, 1x fitted sheet, and 1x standard pillowcase. The top sheet and fitted sheet fit a standard twin mattress, making it perfect for transitioning your kids from their crib to a big kid bed. Trust us, between the super-soft microfiber material and bold Olive Kids pattern, little ones will be cuddled up and dreaming soundly in no time. These Microfiber Twin comforter sets are excellent gift ideas for any event like Friendship Day, Independence Day, Mother's Day, Grandparent's Day, Parent's Day, New Year's Day, Valentine's Day, Halloween, Thanksgiving, and Christmas Day. 90 DAYS WARRANTY AGAINST DEFECTS: We aim for happy customer experience! All of our products feature a 90-day manufacturer's warranty against defects - normal wear-and-tear, and misuse excluded. Conform to all rules and regulations set forth by the Consumer Products Safety Commission. Rigorously tested to ensure that all parts are PVC, BPA and Phthalate-free makes this an eco-friendly option with unmatched quality and a reliable replacement warranty for service you can trust. Click “Add to Cart” now and let your little ones experience convenience and comfort with our Wildkin Microfiber twin bedding sets products!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JqLFVCbEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wildkin","source_asin":"B089TLPWGL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089TLPWGL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089TLPWGL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
