window.products.push({"id":255218,"name":"CUSIMAX 2 Slice Toaster Extra Wide Slots Black Toaster with Ultra-Clear LED Display & 6 Toasting Levels, Cancel/Bagel/Defrost Function, Stainless Stee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S0Eai99KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ SIMPLE TO USE ] -- 1.5 inches extra wide slots in CUSIMAX 2 slice toaster are perfectly wide enough to toast various kinds of bread especially thick-cut bread like croissant, toast, English muffins, bagels or more, make it to be your daily toaster, let you enjoy a rich breakfast everyday! [ MULTIPLE FUNCTION ] -- CUSIMAX Toaster comes with 3 toasting functions ( CANCEL, BAGEL, DEFROST ) with a nice blue light to indicate the function that is in use. Cancel function makes you stop toasting anytime and pops up the toast immediately. Defrost function toasts frozen bread and warms it quickly without burning. Bagel function toasts the cut side of bagels easily. [ SMART TOASTER ] -- With unique SUPER-CLEAR LED Display on the front is not only count down the remaining time until your toast is ready, but also a wonderful visual reminder of the selected browning settings and Bagel or Defrost function, making you enjoy the more efficient morning. The 6 browning settings dial from lightly golden to deep dark, meets your preferences! [ GREAT VALUE FOR THE PRICE ] -- Stainless Steel housing design looks CLASSIC and DURABLE. Combining compact and lightweight design is easy for moving around and storing in cabinet. Due to EXTRA-HIGH LIFT, you can manually pull up the lever after the bread pops up, not afraid to burn fingers, letting you take out the bread easily. Removable tray collects the bread crumbs at the bottom of toaster, making cleaning pretty easy! [ BUY WITH CONFIDENCE ] -- CUSIMAX Led Toaster provides free Lifetime Customer Service and support for 18 Months Warranty. If you have any questions or suggestions during using, just call or email us, we will provide the best service and reply within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S0Eai99KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CUSIMAX","source_asin":"B096513YGV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255218","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096513YGV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096513YGV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
