window.products.push({"id":255364,"name":"Modern JP Adhesive Hat Hooks for Wall (32-Pack) - Minimalist Hat Rack Design, No Drilling, Strong Hold Hat Hangers - U.S. Patent Pending, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713wF9XbtZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ MINIMALIST, LOW PROFILE DESIGN - Our hat holder is designed to showcase your hats, not the hook. When your hats are hanging, our hooks are mostly hidden from view. ✔️ DURABLE & STRONG - Wall hat rack uses strong adhesive that holds up to 3 pounds. CAUTION: We use a strong adhesive to ensure your hooks stay mounted over time. Due to strong adhesive, please place the hook on a surface that does not tear. Do not use on wallpaper and rough surfaces. Use carefully on drywall and painted walls. ✔️ PRESERVE HAT SHAPE - Our hat rack for wall design is curved to keep your hats damage-free. Other conventional hooks or nails put too much weight on a single point on the back of your hat, warping hats. ✔️ MULTI-FUNCTIONAL - Excellent hat storage solution for many types of hats including baseball caps, snapbacks, fitted hats, visors, and flat-brim hats. The hat hanger can also be used as a headphone hanger and other household items that weigh under 3 pounds. ✔️ ROOM DECOR - Arrange the hooks however you'd like to create a stylish hat display. Check out the photos in our customer reviews for inspiration! Unclutter your room within minutes with our easy-to-install hat organizer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713wF9XbtZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modern JP","source_asin":"B09N8G6CW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8G6CW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8G6CW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255365,"name":"SUBEKYU Automatic Trash Can,3.4 Gallon/13L Motion Sensor Bathroom Trash Can with Lid,Waterproof Touchless Trash Can,Smart Trash Can,Slim Narrow Garbag","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LISDZBpeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❶ 【Save space and keep neat】12.2*12*5.9 inches modern slim design, takes up less space. The removable inner bucket holds the trash bag in place and hides the trash bag inside for a neat and clean look. ❷【Two sensing modes】1. Vibration sensing: Touch the trash can with your foot to open the lid.2. Infrared sensing: Open the lid with a wave of your hand within 12 inches of the lid. ❸【IPX5 waterproof 】 Our trash can use advanced IPX5 water resistant technology prevents water or humid environment from damaging the unit. ❹【On-off key operation instructions】1. Long press to turn on or off. 2. After opening the lid,press twice and the lid remains open. ❺【Note】For transportation safety, we do not provide batteries. You need to purchase two AA batteries by yourself. Thank you for your understanding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LISDZBpeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUBEKYU","source_asin":"B0B4562KS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255365","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4562KS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4562KS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255366,"name":"GORNORVA 8 PCS Polaris Vac-Sweep 280 Replacement Screw Parts, C75 10-32-Thread by 7/8-Inch Stainless Steel Pan Head Screw Replacement for Polaris Pool","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rWENv5ShL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a direct replacement set of screws with locking nuts designed to use for the Polaris Vac-Sweep 180 pressure side pool cleaner. These screws are used to lock both the large axle (used for the rear wheel only) as well as the large axle (with sand and gravel guard) into place on the pressure side cleaners frame. The screw slides into the opening on these axles which then connects them to the frame while the nut secures both of these parts into place around the frame.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41rWENv5ShL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GORNORVA","source_asin":"B082FWJQBQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255366","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082FWJQBQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082FWJQBQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
