window.products.push({"id":255376,"name":"Dbgogo Mini Auto Siphon, 2 Pieces 17.7'' Built in Pump Auto-Siphon with Bottling Wand Racking Cane, Homebrew Kombucha Fermentation Siphoning Kit with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AZ3Fq8IrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Anti-Break Tubing Elbow and Will Not Melt in Ethanol: compared to other brand brittle auto siphon, the plastic of our auto-siphon has been upgraded, plastic will not dissolve in beer. will be not easy to crack during transit, the elbow of siphon inner tubing is pretty hard and will not break under normal pressure. every part is made of healthy material which will not produce bad tastes, makes your brewing and bottling become clean! Hand-Operated Siphoning and Not Bring Sediment: compared to the old school racking cane that you have to siphon a hose with mouth or a finger, this auto siphon gets started by a built-in pump, works using gravity, no priming, slides easily, keeps beer clean. lets little chunks get through without clogging, the bottom black tip lets the siphon rest just right on the bottom as to only get the beer not the sediment, results in clearer beer, makes fermentation transferring almost mess free! Not Touch Yeast Cake and Keep Siphon Tubing Stable: this fermentation transferring siphoning kit includes 2 adjustable stabilizer clamps, which allow you to siphon while leaving the lees behind. will not hit the yeast lees by positioning the siphon racking cane to the proper height with using these clips. just clip the siphon tubing to the top of jug or bucket and do not need to worry about the siphon tubing floating away, allow you to control the dispensing, make bottling a one man job! Insert Inner Tube into I.D 5/16'' Outer Hose Easily and No Leaks: an important advantage of our auto siphon is inner tube can be inserted into I.D 5/16'' beer hose with little effort, no need to heat outer hose up with hot water making it stretch to fit inner tube. there are some improvements on the sealing washer to make it more reasonable and produce a good seal between tubing and siphon, the racking bottling wand will not produce any leaks, brewing transferring rate can be increased by 50%! Make the Job of Bottling Your Fermented Creation Much Easier: fits small jugs, carboys, pots, growlers, buckets to transfer kombucha, cider, wine, beer, makes brewing less tedious. also can be used to pup out the remainders found at the bottom of the tank. place secondary container several feet below the primary container to make liquid pumping efficient, raise outer hose above the level of the primary container to stop siphoning. easy to clean by pulling out the \"pump\" part and rinse the rest!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51AZ3Fq8IrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Dbgogo","source_asin":"B0BZY1YX1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255376","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZY1YX1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZY1YX1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
