window.products.push({"id":255429,"name":"LIFEREVO 2 Pack Diamond Quilted Velvet Bed Pillowcases, Pom Poms Fringe Decorative Throw Pillow Shams Set of 2, Soft Bed Pillow Cases Zipper Closure f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJ4XGC2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VELVET MATERIAL: The velvet material used in these soft bed pillowcases is of high quality and feels soft and smooth against the skin. The quilted surface is filled with 120gsm no glue microfiber, making it comfortable to rest your face against. These adorable fringe velvet bed pillow cases have passed the OEKO-TEX certification, indicating that they are skin-friendly and pet-friendly, and resistant to fading, shedding, and pilling. SIZES: This set includes two velvet pillow shams in the same color, insert pillows are not included. The pillow cases are available in two sizes: Standard/Queen size (20\"x26\"), and King size (20\"x36\"). The shams feature a hidden zipper closure in the middle of the back, making these fuzzy pillow cases convenient to wash and maintain. POM POMS DESIGN: The pom-pom throw pillow sham is a charming addition to any bedroom. The cozy quilted bed pillowcases feature decorative white pom poms around the edge, adding a touch of cuteness, fun, and style to your bedding. The little balls are sewn with excellent workmanship and are durable enough to withstand frequent use. They are a perfect complement to your overall bedroom decor and create a cozy, playful atmosphere. DECORATION: Featuring luxurious velvet and charming pom-pom tassels design, these soft cute pillow shams effortlessly add a highlight to your bedroom or living room decor. Their vintage sophistication enhances any collection and they're also versatile enough to use on a couch, sofa, bed, car, seat, window seat, loveseat, floor, bench, office, or cafe. Additionally, they make perfect gifts for occasions such as housewarming, Valentine's Day, Mother's Day, anniversaries, Christmas, and more. CARE & SERVICE: To care for this quilted velvet bed pillowcases, turn it inside-out first and machine wash it on a gentle cycle using cold water. Tumble dry on low and avoid using heat. Do not bleach or iron it. At LIFEREVO, we value your satisfaction and appreciate your love for our products. That's why we offer lifetime customer service. If you have any questions or concerns for the pom-pom pillow shams, please don't hesitate to contact us for a satisfactory solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LJ4XGC2XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIFEREVO","source_asin":"B0833M5SJJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0833M5SJJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0833M5SJJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
