window.products.push({"id":255434,"name":"Chielor 10 Pack Nut Milk Bag, Multi-size Fine Mesh Grade Reusable Cheesecloth Bags Strainers, Unbleached Organic Cotton Filter Bags for Almond Milk, J","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BqgezJCjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH QUALITY UNBLEACHED COTTON MATERIAL】Our organic cotton nut milk bags are made of 100% natural organic cotton, woven to an extremely high standard of quality & durability. Cotton is a natural fiber that is good for the environment, plus you don’t have to worry about nasty chemicals in your food! These nut bags will offer us a safe and healthy choice, bring you with a smooth and satisfyingly silky food. 【DRAWSTRING DESIGN & EASY TO USE】There are 5 different sizes of nut milk bags come in one package, 15 x 10 cm/ 6 x 4 inch, 25 x 20 cm/ 10 x 8 inch, 30 x 20 cm/ 12 x 8 inch, 30 x 25 cm/ 12 x 10 inch, 35 x 30 cm/ 14 x 12 inch, can satisfy various requirements. Sewn-in the top of the bag is a drawstring that can be pulled to tighten and close the bag. Ensure each bag is washed prior to first-time use. 【MULTI-PURPOSE ZERO WASTE NUT MILK BAGS】Chielor nut milk bag are multi-function kitchen tool with dozens of uses. They can be used as all purpose strainer, general filter for blender, homemade juicer/yogurt maker/cheese maker. The bags can also be used for storing fresh produce such and fruit, vegetables, herbs and spices in a cupboard or pantry. Furthermore, more impurities will be filtered out when you filter cold brew coffee or homemade beer wort, honey and etc. 【ENJOY & SHARE HEALTH LIFE】This nut milk bag makes a fantastic gift for people who love to live healthy. Nut milk in particular is rich in vitamins B & E, contains decent amounts of calcium and is free of cholesterol and lactose! Enjoy a delicious dairy-free milk substitute with fewer calories and better taste! Also great use as cloth drawstring gift bags for Christmas, birthday, and weddings 【REMOVE PLASTIC AND SAVE MONEY】 No more plastic bags. Use Chielor organic, biodegradable 100% cotton/muslin storage bag. Natural cotton fabric bags are smooth and soft, which allows for air circulation. They are unbleached and food contact safe. Our bags are made of a high quality 100% cotton material, that means you will never get recycled fibers or other impurities in the cloth, so you can use with complete confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BqgezJCjS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chielor","source_asin":"B0928T2YQ6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255434","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0928T2YQ6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0928T2YQ6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
