window.products.push({"id":255594,"name":"Gripper Tape for Rug, 8pcs 7.87x1.57inches Double Sided Non Slip Reusable, Washable Rug Stopper for Hardwood Floors, Area Rugs, Tiles, Carpets, Floor ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vMmqbts9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"7.87x1.57 inches Strong Grip & Lasting Adhesive - Grippers for rug with unique grip technology and good adhesion make the rug attach to the floor tightly, keeping your rugs steady and safe, no more slips, no more accidents! Carpet tape for hardwood floors solves properly annoying carpet problems like curling, sliding, folding and pet moving. Prevent Curling and Sliding - Advanced double-sided adhesive technology help to keep your rug in place and prevent corner curling. Upgraded grippers fit carpet corners more efficiently, can stop your rugs sliding, make your rug flat and more firmly. The more discs used, the better the rug will be anchored to the floor. The carpet tape is less than 1/10 inch thick, thin and hidden, stays out of sight for a seamless look. Easy to Install & Removable - Follow the instruction, peel the white covering of the rug sticker and stick to the rug, then peel the plastic side of the gripper, finally, press the rug and gripper on the floor. The anti-slip carpet grippers are made of high-quality eco-friendly PU gel, will not hurt the floor and carpet when used, and will not leave any traces when removed. Tips: Please make sure to clean and dry the carpet and floor before using the grippers for best results. Washable and Reusable - If the grippers lose their stickiness or you need to clean the floor under the rug. Use a cleaning cloth with rubbing alcohol and wipe the dirt and debris away to freshen up the sticky pads and dry to restore stickiness, then it will be available again. Note: If the backing of your rugs has fluff or fiber, it is not suggested to remove the grippers from your area rugs to wash. Just clean or wash the grippers on the rug. Widely Applicable - Carpet tape works perfectly with various floors: tiles, hardwood, laminate, marble, concrete, ceramic vinyl, linoleum, etc. These throw carpet grippers are also suitable for carpets of various shapes and sizes. These carpet grippers will reduce the risks of tripping on rugs in the living room, kitchen, hallway, bathroom, foyers, dining room, outdoor spaces, bedrooms, etc. Carpet grips are particularly good for areas where kids are playing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vMmqbts9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZeiLaHao","source_asin":"B09Q7ZYQK7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Q7ZYQK7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Q7ZYQK7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
