window.products.push({"id":255596,"name":"Fashion Bed Group Symmetry Ez Adjustable Base Bed, Queen, Dark Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vP+Fc9MPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Symmetry EZ is an adjustable bed base with a foldable, compact design that allows for UPS-able shipping. With head and foot articulation, this base allows for many body angle adjustments that can potentially help ease stress, reduce soreness in the body, and moderate or eliminate snoring. The numerous position options allow you to receive the highest level of personal comfort and the sleep you need. The wireless remote allows you to control the full-body, head and foot articulation, while also providing a “Free-Fall” safety design feature. The Symmetry EZ base comes with (6) 10.5” steel legs for support and quiet motor that allows for a 700-pound total maximum weight capacity. A dark Gray upholstery and a powder-coated mattress retainer completes the look of this bedroom piece. We watch TV, read, play video games and work from the comfort of our beds. It’s also the oasis of a long workday, where we seek a tranquil environment that inspires relaxation and rejuvenation. Besides being able to provide these needs, this base provides features to help promote a healthy posture during sleep with the user’s comfort in mind. The Leggett & Platt Symmetry EZ Adjustable Bed Base comes with a 1-year full product, 3-year parts and labor, and 10-year parts only warranty. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61vP+Fc9MPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B075GZDQXH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255596","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075GZDQXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075GZDQXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
