window.products.push({"id":255773,"name":"Fuloon Personal Air Cooler,4 in 1 Portable Space Air Conditioner Cooling Fan & Evaporative Spray Humidifier Purifier, Mini USB Desktop ice Fan,7 Color","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CMMENSyaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❄【4 in 1 Air Space Conditioner】Multifunctional desktop cooling mini air conditioner with 4 functions including cooling fan,Purify,Spray humidifies,7 colors LED atmosphere light. This evaporative cooler could maintain the indoor humidity and will not make your skin feel dry.7 colors LED lights can be used as a night light. ❄【Spray Humidification Design】Unlike other mini air conditioners, this cooling fan has a spray humidification hole in the middle, which is not only a cooler but also a humidifier. Use humidification and cool air to create your personal space and bring a cooler experience in the hot summer without wetting the desktop. ❄【3 Wind Speeds Quiet Ice Fan】This Personal Air Cooler has 3 fan speeds, you could select the perfect wind power as you need.It can cool the hot air around you within seconds.In addition,ice water can be added to the water tank to accelerate the cooling speed. ❄【Energy-saving & ECO-FRIENDLY 】This Portable space air conditioner and Humidifier is Freon-free and eco-friendly,It can operate at low energy consumption.This Desk Cooling Fan will makes you save electricity while enjoying a cool and peaceful sleep on a hot summer night.(It equipped with USB cable and power adapter.This air cooler is 5V, 2A.In order to avoid the current is not enough to drive the third wind speed,it is better to connect the power adapter or power bank) ❄【Easy Operation & Portable】This Mini usb evaporative air cooler is Easy to use and esigned portable and compact. The top has an invisible handle for easy carrying.Can be placed on the bedside table, desk, kitchen.perfect for home, office, travel, outdoor activities use, etc","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CMMENSyaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fuloon","source_asin":"B088PMKN4B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255773","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088PMKN4B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088PMKN4B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255774,"name":"Seiko QXW219BLH Mantel Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mP+eKXr7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product description Musical - Quartz movement, One of six hi-fi melodies plays on the hour: Symphony No. 9 Ode To Joy, Die Meistersinger von Numberg Prelude, Greensleeves, An Der Schonen Blauen Doneau, J. Brahms Waltz No. 15 Op. 39-15, Dance of the hours , Automatic silencer, Demonstration button, Black hands, Applied polished gold-tone Arabic numbers, Brushed silver dial, Light brown wooden case with bronze-tone detailing, Light brown wooden stand with gold-tone feet, Three AA batteries included, Dimensions: 10.0H x 14.0W x 4.8D Amazon.com This Seiko mantel clock is an attractive addition to any home. It’s constructed of a brown wooden case. On the hour, the clock plays one of six hi-fi melodies: Symphony No. 9, “Ode to Joy,” Die Meistersinger Von Nurnberg Prelude, Greensleeves, An Der Schonen Blauen Donau, J. Brahms, “Waltz No. 15 Op. 39-15” and Dance of the Hours. Automatic silencer and volume control allows you to control the melodies. Glass crystal protects the Arabic numbers on the adorned dial. The Seiko Story From Humble beginnings, Kintaro Hattoris Vision for Seiko has become reality. A consuming passion for excellence - imprinted in our Corporate DNA passed from generation to generation. Seiko, for 125 years committed to the art and science of time. A culture of innovation connects a 19th century Tokyo clock shop with 20th century advances in timekeeping to an extraordinary 21st century \"quiet revolution.\" Continually driven by dedication and passion, established a multitude of worlds first technologies transforming the principles of timekeeping. The first quartz wristwatch  changed the history of time. The first Kinetic  marked a new era in quartz watch technology. In 1969, Seiko Astron, the first quartz wristwatch - was introduced. In an instant, Seiko exponentially improved the accuracy of wristwatches And Seiko technology firmly established todays standard in Olympic and sports timing. 1984, another celebrated first  Kinetic Technology  powered by body movement. Kinetic  a quartz mechanism with unparalleled accuracy the driving force behind more worlds firsts. Kinetic Chronograph  the next generation of high performance timekeeping. Kinetic Auto Relay  automatically resets to the correct time. Kinetic Perpetual - combining the date perfect technology of perpetual calendar with the genius of Kinetic Auto Relay. And now Kinetic Direct Drive  move, and the watch is powered automatically. Or hand wind it and see the power you are generating in real time. In the realm of fine watches, time is measured by Seiko innovation  A heritage of dedication to the art and science of time. See more","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71mP+eKXr7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SEIKO","source_asin":"B003YU7LTQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255774","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003YU7LTQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003YU7LTQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
