window.products.push({"id":255808,"name":"GreatWhip Whipped Cream Dispenser Professional- Grade Stainless Steel Cream Whipper Large 500ml / 1 Pint Heavy-Duty Whip Cream Maker 3 Decorating Nozz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dzDLM5ZtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOR COLD APPLICATIONS: Perfect for coffee shops, ice cream shops, bakeries, and places where fresh whipped cream is served will keep in your fridge for up to 14 days. MORE HEALTH - Fully constructed with durable food grade stainless steel, making it less reactive and retain the food color and flavor.Three included nozzles allow you to create amazing display effects on cakes and pies. EASY TO CARE FOR AND CLEAN - The canister, head, and 3 decorating tips are easy to clean as they are easy to use. Rinse and allow all parts to dry. And the brush will help you easy to clean the residue, Can also be used in the dishwasher. SAVE TIME & ENERG - Say goodbye to hand mixers or electric mixers that take copious amounts of time and energy to create whipping cream. With a whipped cream maker, fresh and delicious cream can be dispersed in just seconds. MOST PEOPLE'S CHOICES - GreatWhip whip cream dispenser will help you to make the best at baking, cooking, decorating, and more. You get one dispenser but actually get countless helpers.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61dzDLM5ZtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GreatWhip","source_asin":"B09G98ND5R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255808","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09G98ND5R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09G98ND5R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":255809,"name":"Tapered Cork Stoppers Size 12: Pack of 10","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VDKlzWaIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Corks are an unsurpassed sealant for kitchenware, laboratory glassware, masking, and various industrial applications. Impermeable and impervious to chemical interactions with liquid contents, the reusable cork is the perfect sealant. All of our corks are pressed, not amalgamated. Pressed is a more natural state and does not have the glue additives that agglomerated corks have. Unlike petroleum, gas, coal and other diminishing natural resources, cork is the outer bark that grows on replenish-able, renewable, inexhaustible evergreen oaks known by the Latin name Quercus (oak) Suber (cork). Almost 80% of the world's cork comes from the Iberian Peninsula - Portugal (51%) and Spain (28%) where soil, temperature, rainfall, and wind conditions are ideal. Like cows that continually renew their supply of milk or moose that regrow their antlers - the cork tree regenerates its precious outer layer 12 or 13 times during its 150 year lifetime. The outer bark is harvested every 8 to 10 years after the initial first stripping at 15 to 20 years","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61VDKlzWaIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OnlineScienceMall","source_asin":"B0067O0EHC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255809","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0067O0EHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0067O0EHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
