window.products.push({"id":255860,"name":"Oil Sprayer for Cooking-210ml Glass Olive Oil Dispenser Bottle Spray Mister-Reusable Food Grade Oil Vinegar Spritzer Sprayer Bottles, kitchen Gadgets ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.55,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NhgiOfIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Food-Grade Glass [ New Upgrade Rotary Nozzle ] - Single spray a fan mist about 1g（⅕teaspoon）, less oil consumption, 210ml ≈ 300 Quickly Press, more effective control of oil that reduce calories, meet our needs for low-fat healthy living. The nozzle is rotated ,will be different spray effects. Press quickly you will get a foggy effect , halfway down will get a columnar effect. ( Note: The mist effect will be affected by the distance and consistency of the liquids you fill ) [ Safety Glass Material & Ergonomic Handle ] - We use Food-Grade Glass material , high temperature resistant. If it falls on counter it won't shatter. the dispenser is convenient to know the status of oil, easy to recognize the seasoning (oil/vinegar/sauce) quickly. Non-slip push handle easier to use. (Tip: best way to spray is hold the sprayer bottle with 45 degree. If the bottom of the straw is not in the same direction as the nozzle, please pull out the straw and adjust it in the same direction.) [ Sealing & Large Opening ] -Large opening makes the kitchen oil sprayer bottle easy to fill without a funnel, and the specially designed lock-sealed bottle is tightly sealed to prevent leakage. Don’t need to worry about the olive oil leaking or getting dirty, just use the oil sprayer with peace of mind. When you install the lid,make sure you install it tightly.Turn the two halves tightly until you hear a CLICK. Then the oil sprayer head is installed tightly. High efficient use, without wasting. [ Multipurpose Oil Spray Bottle] - This oil spray bottle is perfect tools for home & kitchen. Suitable fora various liquids, oil, vinegar, juice, wine etc; make uniform mist for air fryer, BBQ, making, salad, baking, frying, grilling. It can also be used to spray alcohol and water to clean the kitchen and furniture, and it can also be used to water plants. [ Easy to Clean ] - Oil sprayer Bottle are nice gift for moms, cooks, healthy-conscious individuals, food enthusiasts alike. The design of trigger is ingenious which will make you feel ease to press and easy to cook. And Just open it, adding warm water and detergent, shaking it gently, and then using water to clean it . The rotating nozzle can be taken out , it is more convenient to clean it. the temperature of the washing water should not be higher than 50℃, and it cannot be washed in a dishwasher. If you encounter any product related problems, please contact us in time and we will help you solve them as soon as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NhgiOfIXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tenlary","source_asin":"B09V2JT1L5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-255860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09V2JT1L5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09V2JT1L5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
